          "end": 4.83,
          "en": "that's stored in the first square",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.83,
          "end": 7.41,
          "en": "of this specific winning combination.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.41,
          "end": 11.61,
          "en": "We're taking a look here by accessing game board",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.61,
          "end": 15,
          "en": "which is this multidimensional array here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15,
          "end": 16.89,
          "en": "Keep that in mind.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.89,
          "end": 21.7,
          "en": "And then we first use combination",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.13,
          "end": 25.263,
          "en": "zero dot row.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.55,
          "end": 30.21,
          "en": "Now combination is one of these elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.21,
          "end": 32.73,
          "en": "and it's now this first element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.73,
          "end": 35.823,
          "en": "in this winning combination we're taking a look at.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.66,
          "end": 38.25,
          "en": "So it's this element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.25,
          "end": 41.64,
          "en": "This is the first element in this winning combination.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.64,
          "end": 43.08,
          "en": "Or this would be the element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.08,
          "end": 44.73,
          "en": "in the next winning combination,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.73,
          "end": 47.34,
          "en": "in the next iteration of this for loop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.34,
          "end": 50.463,
          "en": "where we go through all winning combinations.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.08,
          "end": 53.8,
          "en": "And we're now extracting the row",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.77,
          "end": 58.08,
          "en": "to access a row in our game board.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.08,
          "end": 59.7,
          "en": "And then once we access the row,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.7,
          "end": 62.07,
          "en": "we want to access a column in the game board",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.07,
          "end": 64.77,
          "en": "to access one specific square there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.77,
          "end": 69.753,
          "en": "with help of combination zero column.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.22,
          "end": 75.453,
          "en": "And it's now the same logic for the second and third square.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.41,
          "end": 77.97,
          "en": "The difference is just",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.97,
          "end": 81.84,
          "en": "that it's now combination one row and combination one column",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.84,
          "end": 85.203,
          "en": "and combination two row and combination two column.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.63,
          "end": 92.03999999999999,
          "en": "So that step by step, we go through the different squares",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.03999999999999,
          "end": 94.08,
          "en": "that make up one winning combination.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.08,
          "end": 97.11,
          "en": "And we take a look at the symbols that are stored",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.11,
          "end": 100.203,
          "en": "in our game board in these different squares.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 102.24000000000001,
          "end": 105.27000000000001,
          "en": "So now with that, we simply extracted the different squares",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 105.27000000000001,
          "end": 108.6,
          "en": "for the different winning combinations.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 108.6,
          "end": 111.57,
          "en": "And of course now we wanna check if they're all equal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.57,
          "end": 113.88,
          "en": "Because we know that the game is over",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 113.88,
          "end": 116.94,
          "en": "if for a possible winning combination,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 116.94,
          "end": 119.25,
          "en": "all symbols are equal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 119.25,
          "end": 122.07,
          "en": "Like we for example, have it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 122.07,
          "end": 124.38,
          "en": "This would be one possible winning combination",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 124.38,
          "end": 126.153,
          "en": "and all symbols are equal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 127.02,
          "end": 129.75,
          "en": "So now to check if they're equal, we can start",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.75,
          "end": 131.34,
          "en": "by adding a IF check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 131.34,
          "end": 136.053,
          "en": "and start by checking if first square symbol is truthy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.22,
          "end": 140.4,
          "en": "So I don't even wanna start by comparing this to anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 140.4,
          "end": 143.89,
          "en": "I just wanna check if it's not null, basically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 145.41,
          "end": 149.88,
          "en": "because null in JavaScript is treated as a falsey value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 149.88,
          "end": 152.67000000000002,
          "en": "And of course if the value in my game board",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 152.67000000000002,
          "end": 155.85,
          "en": "at a specific position is still null,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 155.85,
          "end": 157.65,
          "en": "I don't need to continue checking",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 157.65,
          "end": 159.72,
          "en": "if it's equal to the other squares",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159.72,
          "end": 162.9,
          "en": "in that winning combination because that square has then",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 162.9,
          "end": 165.183,
          "en": "not been selected by a player yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 166.77,
          "end": 170.31,
          "en": "But if it is truthy, I want to add another condition here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 170.31,
          "end": 173.52,
          "en": "And I wanna check if the first square symbol is equal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 173.52,
          "end": 175.18,
          "en": "to the second square symbol",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 176.19,
          "end": 178.47,
          "en": "because the first square has been selected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 178.47,
          "end": 180.84,
          "en": "and some symbol has been found in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 180.84,
          "end": 183.57,
          "en": "Now I want to check if it's the same symbol",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 183.57,
          "end": 186.483,
          "en": "as in the second square of this winning combination.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 188.1,
          "end": 191.85,
          "en": "And if that's the case, there's a last check I wanna perform",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 191.85,
          "end": 195.81,
          "en": "and I wanna check if this first square symbol is also equal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 195.81,
          "end": 198.123,
          "en": "to the third square symbol.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 200.07,
          "end": 203.19,
          "en": "Because if all three conditions here are met",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 203.19,
          "end": 206.22,
          "en": "I know that all three squares",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 206.22,
          "end": 209.313,
          "en": "of this winning combination contain the same symbol.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 210.81,
          "end": 212.823,
          "en": "And in that case, we have a winner.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 213.99,
          "end": 216,
          "en": "So in that case, I know that the symbol",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 216,
          "end": 218.1,
          "en": "that can be found in these squares",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 218.1,
          "end": 220.413,
          "en": "is the symbol of the winning player.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 221.57999999999998,
          "end": 224.49,
          "en": "Therefore, here we can add a winner variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 224.49,
          "end": 228.48,
          "en": "which initially is undefined or null",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 228.48,
          "end": 231.273,
          "en": "whatever you want because we have no winner yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 232.29,
          "end": 234.06,
          "en": "But if we make it into this IF check,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 234.06,
          "end": 237.423,
          "en": "I'll set winner equal to first square symbol,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 238.77,
          "end": 242.13,
          "en": "so to the symbol of the player who won.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 242.13,
          "end": 244.53,
          "en": "And now we can use this winner variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 244.53,
          "end": 248.01,
          "en": "to conditionally show some game over message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 248.01,
          "end": 251.973,
          "en": "if it is defined, so if it is not undefined.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 254.55,
          "end": 258.03,
          "en": "Therefore down here, maybe above the game board,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 258.03,
          "end": 259.68,
          "en": "we can use this shortcut",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 259.68,
          "end": 261.84,
          "en": "with this double ampersand operator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 261.84,
          "end": 266.1,
          "en": "to check if winner is truthy, if it's an X or an O.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 266.1,
          "end": 267.42,
          "en": "And in that case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 267.42,
          "end": 271.56,
          "en": "we could output a paragraph where we say \"You won\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 271.56,
          "end": 274.38,
          "en": "and then we output the symbol of the winner",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 274.38,
          "end": 276.873,
          "en": "and maybe an exclamation mark thereafter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 279.48,
          "end": 282,
          "en": "Now, that's not the final UI I want to have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 282,
          "end": 283.08299999999997,
          "en": "but it's a start.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 284.1,
          "end": 287.07,
          "en": "And with that, if we save this and I reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 287.07,
          "end": 289.08,
          "en": "I see no message here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 289.08,
          "end": 292.53,
          "en": "But if we now make sure that we do win, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 292.53,
          "end": 296.64,
          "en": "by completing this diagonal combination",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 296.64,
          "end": 300.24,
          "en": "I indeed get \"You won X\" because indeed it is the player",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 300.24,
          "end": 302.313,
          "en": "with the symbol X that won here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 303.69,
          "end": 305.67,
          "en": "Now if I reload again and I make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 305.67,
          "end": 309.457,
          "en": "that the player with the O wins this time, I get",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 309.457,
          "end": 310.677,
          "en": "\"You won O\".",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 312.27,
          "end": 314.43,
          "en": "Now I can still continue playing the game thereafter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 314.43,
          "end": 317.58,
          "en": "which is definitely not the behavior I want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 317.58,
          "end": 321.84,
          "en": "but you can see that we are able to identify a winner.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 321.84,
          "end": 323.64,
          "en": "And therefore, now as a next step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 323.64,
          "end": 327.873,
          "en": "I wanna make sure that we show a nicer game over screen.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
